OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear
OL,6,Fintervals and the odd shower this
OL,7,Fevening. However, cloud thickening
OL,8,Ffrom the east overnight with outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain arriving, some perhaps heavy.
OL,10,FFeeling milder than the previous night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy and wet to start
OL,13,FMonday, though rain becoming confined
OL,14,Fto western parts and turning more
OL,15,Fshowery. Skies brightening from the
OL,16,Feast, allowing for some sunny spells.
OL,17,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
